group_headers.text:
Surah 34–57 (Saba → Hadid)
This group emphasizes Allah’s absolute power, the certainty of revelation, and the reality of the Hereafter. It reminds people that worldly strength does not save anyone and that all authority belongs to Allah alone.
Logic:
Faith becomes firm when one realizes who truly controls everything.
